  <decision id="mvp_decision_public_result" name="公开浇水结果">
    <description>projectWateringReplayResult 的 candidate 出口（MVP 不使用 publicResult），assessMvpWatering 再固定 confidence=low。代码按 soilGate=pause 判断，与 watering_action=pause_watering 等价。conflicting_evidence / no_safe_single_application / not_required 三个供水分支在 MVP 中不会产生，未建模。存在检查窗口但时区缺失时另加 plant_timezone；validUntil=min(盆土有效期, 窗口覆盖终点)。</description>
    <informationRequirement id="mvp_decision_public_result_req_0">
      <requiredDecision href="#mvp_decision_watering_action" />
    </informationRequirement>
    <informationRequirement id="mvp_decision_public_result_req_1">
      <requiredDecision href="#mvp_decision_water_amount" />
    </informationRequirement>
    <decisionTable id="mvp_decision_public_result_table" hitPolicy="FIRST">
      <input id="mvp_decision_public_result_in_0" label="浇水行动">
